{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 18, :comments ["<b>And if</b> — He mentioned the family of Egypt because rain never falls there, for the Nile waters their land, and they would not be concerned if the rain were not upon them. Even though they would not feel the withholding of rain, because of the light the plague of all the nations will come upon them." "<b>And not upon them</b> — the rain will be; a punishment will come upon whoever does not go up." "And the word עליהם serves for another meaning: upon them will be the plague, the one that smites his flesh."], :book :zechariah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 14, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Zecharia -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/zecharya"] ["1" "http://www.daat.ac.il/daat/olam_hatanah/mefaresh.asp?book=25&perek=5&mefaresh=ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:47:07.071636714Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}